Dear Alex,

=20

I hope you are well.=20

=20

I am forwarding the email I sent to the judge just now.=20

=20

I don=E2=80=99t think I can do this by myself. I fought for four years to severe =
my ties from the abuse and the judge, having witnessed my PTSD symptoms and =
distress in full display during the trial, has written a judgement forcing m=
e to share the children=E2=80=99s money with the respondent, forcing me to draft t=
he court orders with the abuser, it is inconceivable.

=20

I submitted 50 pages of Psychiatric reports in support of Jade Mia=E2=80=99s Spec=
ial Needs on 19 April 2023 (she has Asperger, ADHD and other co-occurring di=
sorders) and I always write about the children in all my statements, and in =
the judgement, he stated that there are no medical reports supporting Jade M=
ia=E2=80=99s Special Needs.

=20

I am really sorry, this is wrong, this judgement has the respondent=E2=80=99s fin=
gerprints all over it and I am not saying this lightly.=20

=20

I cannot appeal this, the entire judgement is wrong, every single paragraph=
 is exactly what the respondent wants.=20

=20

I don=E2=80=99t have any money, the respondent has not paid maintenance since Mar=
ch, the judge is not enforcing it despite my requests, the judgement is deny=
ing my daughter=E2=80=99s special needs and I have fought for four years without r=
espite for this.

=20

I need help and there should be an inquiry. I cannot do this by myself and =
there is clearly a problem which needs to be addressed within the court.

=20

I have posted the final hearing documents and will continue to ask for help=
 until my daughters and I have a fair and equitable settlement and are safe.

=20

Rakishev and Mr. Zahmoul each got what they wanted.=20

=20

With kind wishes,

=20

Nadia

=20

