=20

Nadia

=20

Dear Judge,

=20

=20

I intend to prepare an application to appeal the judgement, and an applicat=
ion for a Non-Molestation order.

=20

I am unable to prepare these without legal counsel and I do not have any fi=
nancial resources to pay for my legal advice.

=20

Furthermore, the respondent has not made the payments under the MPS order, =
and the children and I have been subjected to his coercive control and finan=
cial abuse for four years.=20

=20

Finally, I do not speak with the respondent and will not have any contact w=
ith him for the rest of my life. I will not discuss any financial matters wi=
th him and will not be able to prepare court orders without legal representa=
tion. I will address these issues in my appeal application and shall start a=
s soon as I have funding for my legal representation.=20

=20

Sincerely,

=20

Nadia Zahmoul

